      "link": "https://office.thin-sky.cloud/diagram/#doc=---%0Akind%3A+seating%0A---%0A-+Ticket+to+Ride%3A+Hana%2C+Ben%2C+Iris%0A-+Chess%3A+Gus%2C+Wren",
